  "text": "Planning Document: docs/dcps/INNERWEST/Marrickville/Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 1 Lewisham North Precinct 1.pdf\n\nClause 9.1.1 - other (environmental_protection): development within the precinct considers the  potential  impacts to biodiversity\n\nClause 9.1.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect and preserve the identified period buildings within the precinct and \nencourage their sympathetic alteration or restoration.\n\nClause 9.1.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect the i dentified heritage i tems within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.1.2 - height_limit (development_control): To maintain distinc tly single  storey streetscapes that exist  within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.1.2 - other (environmental_protection): To ensure that  new  development considers all potential impacts to biodiversity.\n\nClause 9.1.2 - other (land_use_zoning): To preserve the predominantly low density residen tial character of the precinct.\n\nClause 9.1.2 - parking (development_control): To ens ure that the provision and location of off -street car parking doe s not \nadversely impact the amenity of the precinct.\n\n",
